`campaignPatrolDeclineInterstitial` → `campaignLibraryEncounter`, and
`learningMode`(zth) → `campaignRenderPref` → `campaignDisclaimer` (and back),
confirming both new phase names are in `MENU_PHASES` (menu music keeps
